# flake.lock is committed on purpose -- it is what makes rebuilds reproducible.
# Regenerate deliberately with: nix flake update
#
# dots/nvim/lazy-lock.json is NOT ignored, but note that lazy.nvim cannot write
# it there (Home Manager makes that path a store symlink), so it will not appear
# on its own. See dots/nvim/lua/configs/lazy.lua for how it is generated.

